                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-a60e2057-ffcb-4f40-9670-d3603db5a707" type="clivis" xml:id="m-37e9ad01-faf6-4ed6-a212-33887004cfde">
                    <nc xml:id="m-54cca654-29fb-462c-9600-699f5402143d" pname="c" oct="4" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-fb3f934e-467e-4c9b-a396-35df4ab763d5" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-e6cb5833-254b-40e7-9537-8f77f2978a64">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-51b58a43-dfbf-4587-a061-763bac97ac0a" type="clivis" xml:id="m-23d85c21-1d8f-46a0-a216-6f13b378956b">
                    <nc xml:id="m-333f0635-f84b-42eb-a9f5-973646f2772c" pname="b" oct="3" />
                    <nc xml:id="m-4a05ad1e-c2d8-4663-aad1-fdfa43428da5" pname="a" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <syllable xml:id="m-65795193-d3bc-459d-b3a9-11d30101e4d9">
                  <syl /><neume facs="#m-1334532f-2569-4612-8733-4422fc99f925" type="clivis" xml:id="m-745d6db8-4ecd-4b52-9143-f3e320028907">
                    <nc xml:id="m-fd0cbe8f-6011-4526-9033-da886f8817e2" pname="a" oct="3">
                      <signifLet xml:id="m-ac602bea-e3f2-4e82-840c-c51ffc658782" />
                    </nc>
                    <nc xml:id="m-f56d8fd6-0656-49c9-9a0d-687b59c2ecf9" pname="g" oct="3" />
                  </neume>
                </syllable>
                <divLine xml:id="m-66172dd4-77ae-4617-874e-4878dafd5fd9" facs="#m-f83d93c8-ee57-49b3-b978-ffd7316e34fa" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-84e3dc41-7313-43cf-b960-ecf440bd5772">
              <lg xml:id="m-68910d44-15e7-4125-a630-3b4ee6295f14">
                <l xml:id="m-d7a12b26-d6f2-4d22-bcfe-ad4f7439125c" facs="#m-e45e3728-135a-45d4-b59d-0fc5b39870b4" label="text-like">The Mass of the Paschal Vigil</l><l xml:id="m-ef9e7344-8038-4fea-9c2d-afc73854fc08" facs="#m-7e006799-4ca9-406b-bc34-91dfd9c708d8" label="ambiguous">77en</l><l xml:id="m-8119a32e-c056-4feb-bd74-b627b6e63dd9" facs="#m-a32b2eee-e03a-45dc-9990-4cfc8f7cc03b" label="lyrics-like">et vé-ri- tas Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-165fa666-6861-446d-a918-df393344542b" facs="#m-64cf0ac2-d024-43a3-bb02-e68db0998caf" label="ambiguous">in</l><l xml:id="m-d01d7cd4-f5de-440c-aad7-d788eca5dee1" facs="#m-fc988bb6-4328-4696-bd0c-63742dc927aa" label="lyrics-like">má¬ net</l><l xml:id="m-113714b1-d5ff-4f11-a1fe-69a5ed74a08e" facs="#m-da13d433-1048-445c-8b04-72d42fc140fc" label="lyrics-like">aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-14c647b4-f250-4ac3-b5e2-636e3f4490de" facs="#m-890cdabd-da12-462b-85c9-2eeb6dea07f0" label="ambiguous">num.</l><l xml:id="m-340b0e6e-d267-4426-9671-cf2c1afebb15" facs="#m-8cbafccf-942b-4388-91a7-047e3c62e5be" label="text-like">Candles are not carried at the Gospel, but only incense. The blessing is</l><l xml:id="m-a4750ac5-0583-41af-8be0-18dcad086e57" facs="#m-b29dfdde-95c9-4d72-9a62-22564da00f4c" label="text-like">given and everything else tahes place as usual.</l><l xml:id="m-a92b4653-1835-4c43-bc73-034b621f43a8" facs="#m-617ccb73-2744-4922-bec4-fc847f450f19" label="ambiguous">★Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum.</l><l xml:id="m-06b062fd-bd30-45a5-b917-28e640340d98" facs="#m-4c7060b1-d72b-4f24-9b97-7d7a52875319" label="ambiguous">Matth. 28, 1-7</l><l xml:id="m-4dbdb22b-39d7-45df-84d0-a659d9af6062" facs="#m-14a41d23-62aa-4035-9cd7-343bd488cb7c" label="lyrics-like">L/Espere autem sábbati, quae Respóndens autem Angelus, di¬</l><l xml:id="m-b299fdd1-0bc0-41e3-be4b-361c5bc82a1c" facs="#m-701e39ca-0800-4ee0-8525-5273fab49adb" label="lyrics-like">lxit muliéribus: « Nolite timére</l><l xml:id="m-fccd829f-b2a7-4b74-a3e8-887ccda89e9d" facs="#m-c9d7b7fa-67d8-478e-93de-10802376ad82" label="lyrics-like">»lucéscit in prima sábbati.</l><l xml:id="m-a1a1b5d1-22a0-46e0-8fad-b6252ef5df11" facs="#m-e1724b51-64ac-499f-972a-85e0c8b02e73" label="lyrics-like">venit Maria Magdaléne, et áltera</l><l xml:id="m-b083e3c5-fdc2-4bc4-8e87-68e2d957cfa7" facs="#m-b673c655-67df-4d76-b223-3b1d94c7b22a" label="ambiguous">vos: scio enim, quod Jesum,</l><l xml:id="m-5ff8a629-4ed9-44c4-9aa6-c482baf11538" facs="#m-35348c6f-1345-41f2-aa7b-4a88844fcc6a" label="lyrics-like">Maria, vidére sepúlerum. Et ecce</l><l xml:id="m-8797b309-d0ad-4dfb-8e05-bef34c87c159" facs="#m-10cbf671-f586-421a-b7fe-deae7fa07b34" label="lyrics-like">qui crucifixus est, quaéritis:</l><l xml:id="m-9a5162db-34e9-443d-949e-cf95267312fa" facs="#m-92f587d2-5016-4844-aacb-d33fe2b212c8" label="lyrics-like">non est hic: surréxit enim,</l><l xml:id="m-b550e500-0607-4256-a923-4268547b569f" facs="#m-834982d3-f421-45f7-86bc-365997e13533" label="lyrics-like">terraemótus factus est magnus.</l><l xml:id="m-508afbb8-d734-4f47-923e-19f052805e55" facs="#m-83af3da1-f5bb-4ea5-9125-5ea5a0cc9264" label="lyrics-like">sicut dixit. Venite, et vidéte</l><l xml:id="m-a96913fb-17fd-4d7a-8067-1244830ee5ce" facs="#m-94230bc2-bdff-4b20-aa11-694de147c23d" label="lyrics-like">Angelus enim Dómini descéndit</l><l xml:id="m-931fc3c6-aa97-4f9e-a402-8729c5788a19" facs="#m-a309e448-a966-4bde-88f7-9ef49bfe8b79" label="lyrics-like">locum ubi pósitus erat Dóminus.</l><l xml:id="m-a1388a9b-7e28-4023-b43f-e654cd9f8241" facs="#m-6c45b167-e8f3-4d77-901b-165dbeed2dab" label="lyrics-like">de caelo: et accédens revólvit</l><l xml:id="m-6b76d933-c428-4006-9e9b-4fc9408c1997" facs="#m-532f5b47-c917-4060-bce0-da482702469b" label="lyrics-like">Et cito eúntes, dicite discipulis</l><l xml:id="m-c50d7611-d416-4cc3-8d9e-59c60831cfa8" facs="#m-ca95e5fc-453d-4b6f-bc55-ccbd1c905a39" label="lyrics-like">lápidem, et sedébat super eum:</l><l xml:id="m-9d6445e8-9a69-4bb8-822b-8d774756ecb8" facs="#m-b63f588e-64ef-4627-a9a4-361f797e53f8" label="lyrics-like">erat autem aspéctus ejus sicut</l><l xml:id="m-0475108c-9ac9-4236-9ded-d5eaf16dfe83" facs="#m-14492eda-7bfe-411f-80c0-e5f8287419ff" label="lyrics-like">ejus quia surréxit: et ecce</l><l xml:id="m-763077e9-c842-4829-bed4-a3f188321cc3" facs="#m-5a927174-c915-4542-844a-01112539c806" label="lyrics-like">praecédit vos in Galilaéam: ibi</l><l xml:id="m-9b137e84-bb39-43bc-924b-3d272fc3e38f" facs="#m-4679c2cf-bda8-48ec-ae44-4033e170213a" label="lyrics-like">fulgur: et vestiméntum ejus</l><l xml:id="m-808104fa-b450-4533-8e1a-237caf4bd366" facs="#m-46f38a89-46b2-4e7d-a339-e16c45aa3831" label="lyrics-like">eum vidébitis. Ecce praedixi</l><l xml:id="m-14a40838-9c37-4891-943f-03beb5c70496" facs="#m-3e9fc267-d690-4f23-ae77-b98dda7407ab" label="lyrics-like">sicut nix. Prae timóre autem</l><l xml:id="m-11ad5915-b5ee-471f-976f-65801e4fcfb2" facs="#m-246a9540-9e5d-43a4-9495-437b538aaed7" label="lyrics-like">ejus extérriti sunt custódes,</l><l xml:id="m-1234b730-67eb-4a9b-a386-be72424fb796" facs="#m-1e61e4ff-6a04-41a4-a7c9-1c9672e67b8c" label="ambiguous">vobis ».</l><l xml:id="m-f511d41a-a4b3-4bdf-8c23-86e9f1b33250" facs="#m-04d88451-e3e6-45a5-8732-27eff27de5fa" label="lyrics-like">et facti sunt velut mórtui¬</l><l xml:id="m-509579e8-a49a-4294-9a97-39cf05c2c823" facs="#m-37a0f57a-300f-46d6-8271-db5d1dbb0598" label="text-like">The Credo is not said, but when the Gospel is finished, the celebrant sines</l><l xml:id="m-32a43f91-1e08-4491-a46a-e11c432ceaaa" facs="#m-3ee17ea7-ca90-4165-a147-d3ad67aa1305" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus vobiscum, then: Orémus. There is no Offertory Antiphon. At</l><l xml:id="m-635b8606-efc0-4514-8067-ba9de3d89f18" facs="#m-5eb9cbf9-64bb-4a5b-8662-a25d1717c28c" label="lyrics-like">the Lavábo Gloria Patri is said.</l><l xml:id="m-e495194c-4a65-4249-a7ae-c286d786a1bb" facs="#m-58e9f517-d96e-410f-90b8-9ef40ab6859f" label="ambiguous">Secret</l><l xml:id="m-677070d9-b96d-4ad9-b1ba-6c42856ab5dd" facs="#m-fdde3659-6f2c-45da-a00a-a6b6cdf0b596" label="lyrics-like">YUscipe, quaésumus, Dómine, libus initiáta mystériis, ad aeter¬</l><l xml:id="m-62b8bef3-79a7-4901-869a-5af7c813a326" facs="#m-c673a9ae-2642-4e3d-84a0-014adaa182d0" label="lyrics-like">Opreces pópuli tui, cum obla-l nitátis nobis medélam. te ope¬</l><l xml:id="m-d8a967a3-00a6-4665-8430-26860e50e464" facs="#m-69403cb0-c08f-410c-b2b6-c38c674fb7f5" label="lyrics-like">tiónibus hostiárum: ut paschá-lránte, proficiant. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-b9c2cb69-f75f-49e6-9265-3954667a971f" facs="#m-6c798fc8-22d1-4abd-857e-a44959e8df31" label="lyrics-like">Preface Te quidem, Dómine, omni témpore, sed in hac potissimum</l><l xml:id="m-2b5fdf55-984c-4979-8fea-b9b7c117e45e" facs="#m-66f176bd-c5cc-4187-b302-aca1936f18fe" label="ambiguous">nocte, p. 8.</l><l xml:id="m-56037b53-ed83-4ca9-bb39-44818da7e253" facs="#m-e09918b3-e665-43cb-9fc9-97c3495790f2" label="text-like">AT THE CANON</l><l xml:id="m-3afc678a-1f2d-4d87-a682-79bf61dcd756" facs="#m-ddf9494a-ec2d-468e-b22a-8bd063149182" label="lyrics-like">Communicántes et noctem sacratissimam celebrántes Resur¬</l><l xml:id="m-fbb8e0c0-509a-48f2-a835-527b52cc63fc" facs="#m-c21e94a0-5cfd-4754-9a20-58bda206f5c7" label="lyrics-like">rectiónis, p. 4.</l><l xml:id="m-590d1611-46d2-4a72-84ff-11881d6cbfde" facs="#m-7703388e-1203-479c-97fa-a994fc00b054" label="ambiguous">Hanc igitur, p. 5.</l><l xml:id="m-b947d08a-5a84-4b5c-a334-c577c4cd5ec2" facs="#m-e48aa1d6-68e4-4855-a474-96eda1a400c7" label="lyrics-like">Pax Dómini is said, but not Agnus Dei; the hiss of peace is not given.</l><l xml:id="m-ee6c2bfe-c9fa-4966-90c2-437790d063d7" facs="#m-5820fdfa-0c37-4b44-87fb-eeb2e0b3f6d6" label="lyrics-like">The Praver Dómine lesu Christe, qui dixisti, is omitted, but the other</l><l xml:id="m-dce279a6-463c-4cd3-84e5-0ef75473a36e" facs="#m-1d2ab25c-a698-40f6-95fb-d182fc9797e2" label="lyrics-like">Prayers Dómine Jesu Christe, Fili Dei vivi, and Percéptiõ Córporis tui,</l><l xml:id="m-f5d51d77-59ab-4d0e-a980-333eeed6c637" facs="#m-d3c3ea89-e4b7-406d-8a02-397035dda175" label="text-like">are said as usual.</l><l xml:id="m-e0e36bbb-4cbf-45f6-9e59-2e0c44de9f34" facs="#m-535bf7e0-6196-48ef-b123-e8173813f6c5" label="text-like">8. After the Priest's Communion, Holy Communion is distributed, and</l><l xml:id="m-0c705430-e0ae-46d3-b7db-59d6ad649e2d" facs="#m-4787a009-b237-46e0-b308-42f58d700160" label="text-like">the purification and ablutions take place as usual.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>